  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p>In January we launched the Evidence-Based Eating Guide, which is available for free download <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/healthkit/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>. Today I’m excited to announce that you can now order hard copies of the guide at-cost over on <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/outreach/products/healthkit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/outreach/products/healthkit\">DrGreger.org</a>. The guide is a run-down of my practical tips in booklet form, including summaries of my Traffic Light system and Daily Dozen checklist, as well as tips for putting them into practice.</p>\n<p>As a current subscriber, you can also download digital PDFs: here’s an <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/shared/static/zj1sqcr4o9ytkg7mvv6vx9pv8aa08zz4.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/shared/static/zj1sqcr4o9ytkg7mvv6vx9pv8aa08zz4.pdf\">online version</a>, and a fewer-page <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/shared/static/daqjmzoiq1wm6ptsiwfd5pd90a15tuin.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/shared/static/daqjmzoiq1wm6ptsiwfd5pd90a15tuin.pdf\">printable version</a> (best when printed single-sided). </p>\n<p>Now that there are physical copies, hopefully you’ll see stacks in a doctor’s office near you!</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4 class=\"mc-toc-title\">More Ways to Donate</h4>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-58123 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/03/Amazon-Smile-IG-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/03/Amazon-Smile-IG-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/03/Amazon-Smile-IG-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/03/Amazon-Smile-IG-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/03/Amazon-Smile-IG-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/03/Amazon-Smile-IG-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/03/Amazon-Smile-IG-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/03/Amazon-Smile-IG.png 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/>You can support NutritionFacts.org with Amazon Smile. Sometimes it’s easy to forget to type in <a href=\"http://smile.amazon.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=http://smile.amazon.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1552426130711000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFXHT6Am1barGuiNEQzHOawShIfzQ\" data-cke-saved-href=\"http://smile.amazon.com/\">smile.amazon.com</a> before shopping at Amazon. To make sure you never forget, please consider using <a href=\"https://couponfollow.com/smilematic#05-0559626\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://couponfollow.com/smilematic%2305-0559626&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1552426130711000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGBjym9f0WEt_RGPgT5WxlxZSkybA\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://couponfollow.com/smilematic#05-0559626\">Smilematic</a>, a free browser extension that ensures your Amazon purchases will be able to support NutritionFacts.org.</p>\n<p>And we’ve teamed up with Giving Assistant to make it easier to donate and to also help you save money when you shop online. <a href=\"https://givingassistant.org/np#nutritionfacts-org-inc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://giving-assistant.intercom-mail.com/via/e?ob%3DU%252BQmCr16ihKj6FUh1ORZoKx%252B%252Fu7N7e%252F6ln%252FegkqgoHv36tn1DSep2XY0bYK1Ln4cMrUAC5P0O1flpC%252BW0SgRnw%253D%253D%26h%3D2744fe8482b371dcc86620f9a7228ef9f704dd87-21017547336%26l%3De6150fbb295d677953b82f893ec8f0387cc8db7e-171735&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1552426130688000&amp;usg=AFQjCNH2iAocJnbxjMdS0BzOt_leqysAPg\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://giving-assistant.intercom-mail.com/via/e?ob=U%2BQmCr16ihKj6FUh1ORZoKx%2B%2Fu7N7e%2F6ln%2FegkqgoHv36tn1DSep2XY0bYK1Ln4cMrUAC5P0O1flpC%2BW0SgRnw%3D%3D&amp;h=2744fe8482b371dcc86620f9a7228ef9f704dd87-21017547336&amp;l=e6150fbb295d677953b82f893ec8f0387cc8db7e-171735\">Simply sign up through this link</a>, download <a href=\"https://givingassistant.org/np#nutritionfacts-org-inc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://giving-assistant.intercom-mail.com/via/e?ob%3DZh4Pp529%252FN9JZKWJKoQkqf9JLSET%252FA51EOwGUDT%252Fy80JsG5ldCqu7tSpTgHmKTmK%26h%3Ddecfa855ee2ff4cb1a680bc1b0b23bbf0d6b6095-21017547336%26l%3D91ce285b1c083b3c25b8b48dff88a96bce78ed88-171831&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1552426130688000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEorHCaFC5NZIERfIimeKQ6OjNwrg\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://giving-assistant.intercom-mail.com/via/e?ob=Zh4Pp529%2FN9JZKWJKoQkqf9JLSET%2FA51EOwGUDT%2Fy80JsG5ldCqu7tSpTgHmKTmK&amp;h=decfa855ee2ff4cb1a680bc1b0b23bbf0d6b6095-21017547336&amp;l=91ce285b1c083b3c25b8b48dff88a96bce78ed88-171831\">the browser extension</a>, and when you save by shopping online at over 3,000 stores, you can give a percentage of your savings to NutritionFacts.org. </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Recent Media</h4>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-58121\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/03/IMG_8845-960x640.jpg\" alt=\"Michael Greger\" width=\"200\" height=\"133\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/03/IMG_8845-960x640.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/03/IMG_8845-768x512.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/03/IMG_8845-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/03/IMG_8845-1200x800.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/03/IMG_8845-720x480.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/03/IMG_8845-540x360.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/>The <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/dr-gregers-interview-with-gianna-simone/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Gianna Simone interview</a> was so popular I thought I’d start sharing some of my interviews to pass along to curious friends and family. Here’s a recent article in the <a href=\"https://hk.asiatatler.com/life/how-not-to-die-michael-greger-interview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://hk.asiatatler.com/life/how-not-to-die-michael-greger-interview\">Hong Kong Tatler</a> and an interview on the <a href=\"https://elitemanmagazine.com/how-to-not-die-dr-michael-greger/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://elitemanmagazine.com/how-to-not-die-dr-michael-greger/\">Elite Man Podcast</a>.</p>\n<p>Speaking of spreading the message, I’m currently planning my 2020 speaking tour. If you want to set up a venue in your community for me to come speak, just fill out the form <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/speaking-inquiries/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a> and we will be in touch. And thank you to everyone who submitted a form already. We are going through those and will be in touch. I can’t wait to see you all!</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Live Q&amp;As Are Back!</h4>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-53879\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-960x960.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/>I’m back to doing monthly Q&amp;As live from my treadmill, and <em><strong>April 25</strong></em> is the next date.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Facebook Live</strong>: At 12:00 p.m. ET on 4/25 go to our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Dc1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913%26id%3Dafe9299fd2%26e%3D545b7f785a&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516314018432000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEIgGkyjkXIfYHCVfz6o5PQOxSkhw\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\">Facebook page</a> to watch live and ask questions.</li>\n<li><strong>YouTube Live Stream: </strong>At 1:00 p.m. ET on 4/25 go <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cx0USAbvWqk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Dc1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913%26id%3D88539af304%26e%3D545b7f785a&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516314018432000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEvfR6sb4jzTlryjwFO0t9k3RiaJA\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cx0USAbvWqk\">here</a> to watch live and ask even more questions! </li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can now find links to all of my past live YouTube and Facebook Q&amp;As right <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>. If that’s not enough, remember I have an audio podcast to keep you company at <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u=c1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913&amp;id=9c5c1ac6dc&amp;e=545b7f785a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Dc1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913%26id%3D9c5c1ac6dc%26e%3D545b7f785a&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516314018432000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGoL2STvivkREYbL3IbSQpGMo_YSw\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u=c1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913&amp;id=9c5c1ac6dc&amp;e=545b7f785a\">https://nutritionfacts.org/audio.</a></p>\n<p>In health,</p>\n<p><b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\"><u><b>here</b></u></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><u><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><u><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><u><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><u><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><u><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></u></a></li>\n</ul>"
